      "username": "anilpoda",
      "name": "Anil",
      "created_at": "2025-04-30T06:27:25.047Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, recently I have transferred employee from Vizag to Hyderabad using employee transfer. Now Hyderabad HR is not able access transferred employee record. When I try to open that Employee record, I see below warning popup. How can I overcome this issue?</p>\n<h2><a name=\"p-466639-not-allowed-for-branch-visakhapatnam-in-row-1-restricted-field-branch-user-hrhyderabadexamplein-does-not-have-access-to-this-document-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-466639-not-allowed-for-branch-visakhapatnam-in-row-1-restricted-field-branch-user-hrhyderabadexamplein-does-not-have-access-to-this-document-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Not allowed for Branch: Visakhapatnam in Row 1. Restricted field: branch<br>\nUser <strong>hr.hyderabad@example.in</strong> does not have access to this document</h2>\n<p>Insufficient Permission for <strong>Employee E00515</strong></p>",
