      "id": 467013,
      "username": "anilpoda",
      "name": "Anil",
      "created_at": "2025-05-05T05:03:24.274Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have created a new Property Setter for <strong>branch</strong> field of <strong>Internal Work History</strong> child table to <strong>ignore_user_permissions</strong> and <strong>set value</strong> to <strong>1</strong></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/4/842be5438f0fc29ffe3a560aee6e019a5e5c10c6.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/842be5438f0fc29ffe3a560aee6e019a5e5c10c6\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/4/842be5438f0fc29ffe3a560aee6e019a5e5c10c6_2_578x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"iRf4spxw5Aj7oyIIGWcVMFNjYFg\" width=\"578\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/4/842be5438f0fc29ffe3a560aee6e019a5e5c10c6_2_578x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/4/842be5438f0fc29ffe3a560aee6e019a5e5c10c6.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/4/842be5438f0fc29ffe3a560aee6e019a5e5c10c6.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">741×640 20.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
